00:49:26.064 --> 00:49:28.998
It's just a dream.


00:49:29.968 --> 00:49:31.534
I didn't kill my family.


00:49:31.536 --> 00:49:33.669
Yes, Molly.


00:49:33.671 --> 00:49:35.071
You did.


00:49:36.107 --> 00:49:38.641
My brother
was in love with me.


00:49:38.643 --> 00:49:40.376
No, Molly.


00:49:40.378 --> 00:49:42.111
